NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY DATA (see vendor/)

This repository bundles, for offline reverse-engineering convenience, several
third-party artifacts that are NOT covered by the MIT license above:

  * vendor/filediver/       - FileDiver data-library dumps (xypwn/filediver)
  * vendor/community/       - community-decoded game data (shalzuth/HelldiversData)
  * vendor/hd2-lua-mod/     - the "hd2-lua-mod" skill package
  * vendor/ref/             - typelib dumps generated from the game's own type library

They remain the property of their respective authors and are included only as
research tooling. No game assets, audio, models or textures are redistributed.

This project contains NO game code, assets or binaries. Every delivered mod is
a runtime, in-memory Lua addon that reads/writes the live process of a locally
installed copy of the game. Nothing here modifies any file on disk.
